          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.2.1+EPH.2.2+EPH.2.3+EPH.2.4+EPH.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aefeso 2:1–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho kala tamdzangbwemkuluphira Jesu kala mkafwa chiroho kpwa sababu ya dambi, na kala munatawalwa ni asili zenu za chibinadamu. Ela bada ya kumkuluphira, Mlungu wakuphani maisha maphya. Naye wahuswamehe dambi zehu zosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aefeso 2:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kama avi mahendo gehu gosi ga dambi kala gakaandikpwa, huchishitakiwa kotini, na huchiphahikana na makosa. Phahi Mlungu wahufutira makosa gehu phara Jesu ariphokotwa msalabani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na achishinda viumbe vyosi vii vyokala na uwezo. Tsona achivigbwiza haya kpwa kuamanyisa atu osi kuhusu ushindi wa Jesu ariouphaha msalabani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
